msgctxt "79\t167"
msgid "Do you know the man who shot Daigo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "178\t258"
msgid "Unfortunately, I can't say I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "266\t318"
msgid "I should've known."
msgstr "Avrei dovuto immaginarlo."

msgctxt "332\t515"
msgid ""
"You mean that Kazama look-alike, right?\\nDamn. Wish we knew what he wants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "550\t697"
msgid "Wait, did you say Kazama?\\nIs he the one who pulled the trigger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720\t780"
msgid "Do you know him?"
msgstr "Oh, lo conosci?"

msgctxt "816\t876"
msgid "Mhm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884\t1096"
msgid ""
"If the Kazama I know and the one you're\\ntalking about are the same man, "
"that is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1109\t1313"
msgid "Then tell me. This Kazama you know...\\nJust who is he?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1341\t1401"
msgid "Joji Kazama."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1405\t1623"
msgid ""
"Younger brother of Shintaro Kazama, former patriarch\\nof the Kazama Family "
"you once belonged to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1634\t1740"
msgid "Kazama-san had... a brother?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1762\t1818"
msgid "You weren't aware?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1822\t1877"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1882\t2044"
msgid "I see. I suppose it's not a surprise\\nhe never mentioned that fact."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2053\t2108"
msgid "It's not?"
msgstr "Non lo è?"

msgctxt "2112\t2250"
msgid ""
"No. You see, after Shintaro lost both his parents at a very young age..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2265\t2392"
msgid "His brother Joji was his only surviving relative."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2395\t2485"
msgid "Such a bond is nigh unbreakable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2557\t2744"
msgid ""
"If he and Joji were really that tight-knit,\\nyou'd think he would've "
"mentioned the guy to Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2758\t2850"
msgid "How close they were doesn't matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2854\t3055"
msgid ""
"There's simply no chance they could have\\nlived as normal brothers. None at"
" all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3061\t3121"
msgid "And why's that?"
msgstr "E per quale motivo?"

msgctxt "3151\t3310"
msgid "They were walking two conflicting paths in life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3322\t3432"
msgid "So wait. You're saying Kazama's brother was..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3440\t3487"
msgid "A cop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3490\t3708"
msgid ""
"He used to work in what is now currently\\nknown as the Foreign Affairs "
"Division."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3710\t3820"
msgid "Whoa. Only the most elite officers get in there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3859\t4044"
msgid ""
"Elite, huh? I can see how you'd think so,\\ngiven your history on the force."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4058\t4107"
msgid "It's funny, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4109\t4294"
msgid "Two men who wore the same badge to\\nprotect the future of our nation..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4296\t4547"
msgid ""
"One sits in this stuffy office sipping whisky all day,\\nthe other plies his"
" trade on American shores."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4562\t4655"
msgid "What? You don't mean..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4670\t4798"
msgid "Joji and I came up through the ranks together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4848\t4941"
msgid "He's the only friend I have in this harsh world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4943\t5076"
msgid "What? You and Kazama's brother!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5088\t5313"
msgid ""
"Everything that's happened in Okinawa to this point...\\nJoji and I "
"orchestrated the whole thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5323\t5443"
msgid "What do you mean, \"orchestrated\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5447\t5640"
msgid ""
"I formulated the plan, while Joji used\\nhis organization to carry it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5646\t5875"
msgid "Then... Joji shooting Daigo.\\nWas that part of the plan, too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5880\t5940"
msgid "I can't rule out the possibility."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5943\t6116"
msgid ""
"And what organization are you talking about?\\nIs Joji still with the force?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6124\t6184"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6189\t6307"
msgid "He left the Japanese police years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6314\t6398"
msgid "Then what are you talking about?"
msgstr "Di cosa stai parlando?"

msgctxt "6436\t6550"
msgid "He's working for the American CIA. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6606\t6791"
msgid ""
"To be precise, he's with the Central Intelligence\\nAgency's Far East "
"Intelligence division."
msgstr ""
